      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
      zoo:text "25 Flocks so registered could be pastured on public lands on payment of the scriptum (registration tax). Thayer's Note: For details see the article Scriptura in Smith's Dictionary of Greek and Roman Antiquities." .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/257>
