      zoo:text "76 Quintus Caecilius Metellus Pius Scipio, consul with Pompey for part of the year 52 B.C." .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/312>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 312 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
      zoo:text "64 This strange operation is more clearly described by Columella, VIII.2.3, 'And yet they experience this (lack of desire) not through the loss of their generative organs, but by having their spurs burned off with a red-hot iron.' See also Pliny, N. H., X.50." .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/300>
