      zoo:text "75 χηνοβοσκεῖον, 'a place for feeding geese.'" .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/311>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 311 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
      zoo:text "63 The outstanding success of the Delians as poultrymen is attested by Columella (VIII.2.4). Pliny (N. H., X.139) states that they were the first to fatten poultry for market." .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/84>
