<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/202>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 202 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
      zoo:text "91 For the white oxen of Umbria, used especially at triumphs, cf. Virgil, Georg., II.146. Thayer's Note: See also Propertius IV.1; for further citations and details, including the precise region of Umbria and a photograph of what may be a descendant of the Roman breed, see Bovara." .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/214>
