      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/1/58> ;
      zoo:text "'Cato says⁠ 107 that smaller and larger Aminnian grape, and the Apician, are best stored in jars, and that the same grapes keep well also in boiled or plain must; and that the best ones for drying are the hard grapes and the Aminnian." .

